Aim:
To create an Online Cake Ordering System website using HTML and CSS.

Algorithm:

Create the basic HTML structure of the website.
Add a navigation menu with Home, Cakes, and Contact sections.
Display available cakes with their names and prices.
Add cake descriptions and available flavors.
Create an order section with cake selection and quantity options.
Add customer login and registration sections.
Apply CSS to style the website.
Run the HTML file in a web browser.

Result:
The Online Cake Ordering System website was successfully created using HTML and CSS.
